    "Cost": 1552714,
    "UIName": "Nightsky",
    "Id": "chassisdef_nightsky_NGS-7S",
    "Name": "Nightsky",
    "Details": "When the LCAF asked Defiance to update the Nightsky for the new century, the company happily obliged. Concerns about the 'Mech's flagging sales had already led to an internal proposal to enhance its capabilities with components available within the DefHes supply chain. The Lyran Quartermaster Corps was stunned when presented with detailed blueprints within hours of their request, with an advanced design including Heavy Ferro-Fibrous armor and a mix of Clan tech ER lasers and X-pulses.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Melee Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.04</color></b>",
